   "subject": "Low n_eff in measurement model",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone,<div><br></div><div>I have written a relatively straightforward linear model in Stan to capture a data-generating process in which users give their perceptions of the placement of a series of items on a scale. Some users are precise in their placements of the items and others are error-prone. Some items are also more difficult to place than others. I want to capture heterogeneity in individual-specific error using a multiplicative term (as done in the literature): item-specific error x individual-specific error. I have set up a model that works well with both simulated and real data without the term to capture heterogeneity in item-placement error. However, when I build on this simpler model by adding in the multiplicative term, the n_eff plummets into the single digits, and the model takes forever to fit. Does anyone have any thoughts on what might be going wrong here?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance!</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n_items</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n_respondents</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// respondent i</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// item j</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// item response z_ij</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br><br>parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_respondents</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Individual-specific shift</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_respondents</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Individual-specific stretch</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_items</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeta_raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Latent &#39;true&#39; position of item</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real zeta_mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeta_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_items</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Item-specific variance for placement (some items more difficult to place than others)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_k</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Item-specific variance for a unique item in the data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_respondents</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Individual-specific variance for item placement</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_i_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_respondents</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> theta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Latent position of individual-specific unique item</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>transformed parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_items</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// For identification</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_items</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeta_raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Priors</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  alpha </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  beta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  zeta_mu </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  zeta_sigma </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> uniform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  zeta_raw </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zeta_mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeta_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  theta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// For identification</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  tau_j </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  tau_k </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br><br>  tau_i_sigma </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  tau_i </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_i_sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Likelihood</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n_items </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> theta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_k </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Note the multiplicative error term here</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">// Note the multiplicative error term here</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
